+The dense order's "breathing mode" is the genesis shock's acoustic ringdown of the box (period and lifetime ∝ side), and its Fano N-scaling is the identity Fano_w = w·ν·n·m² with the relative modulation m bounded at 1.3-2.4% — no coherence, no ratio tail, and no dephasing fix needed: the allocator danger checker2 flagged is priced, bounded, and self-extinguishing.
